{
 "lang": "en",
 "duration": 47.254625,
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 4.96,
   "text": "The reason you still can't create a viral edit comes down to one thing and one thing only."
  },
  {
   "start": 5.26,
   "end": 9.24,
   "text": "It's not because you don't have a special course and it's not because you can't do it."
  },
  {
   "start": 9.34,
   "end": 10.84,
   "text": "The information is available everywhere."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.94,
   "end": 11.72,
   "text": "Look around you."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.82,
   "end": 14.12,
   "text": "How many professional video editors do you see?"
  },
  {
   "start": 14.3,
   "end": 17.62,
   "text": "None of them were born this way and none of them had it easier than you."
  },
  {
   "start": 17.72,
   "end": 22.5,
   "text": "The only difference is that they were willing to put in the work even when they didn't feel like it."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.62,
   "end": 27.2,
   "text": "The problem I see with most editors today is honestly they're just not willing to work hard enough."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.2,
   "end": 30.24,
   "text": "Success is a combination of knowledge and hard work."
  },
  {
   "start": 30.46,
   "end": 33.46,
   "text": "You need to know what to do and you need to go and actually do it."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.74,
   "end": 38.5,
   "text": "There are hundreds of editing tutorials for you to watch and there's so many courses for you to invest in."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.7,
   "end": 41.22,
   "text": "You just haven't sat down and actually done it."
  },
  {
   "start": 41.38,
   "end": 42.44,
   "text": "So this is your reminder."
  },
  {
   "start": 42.74,
   "end": 46.92,
   "text": "Don't let this be another day that passes without you getting one step closer to your goal."
  }
 ],
